{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>מוצאי</b> Two times in the Masorah: here and the other: כי מוצאי מצא חיים. And this is what they said, of blessed memory: to those who learn from its right side — elixir of life; to those who learn from its left side — elixir of death. And this is: והיה כל מוצאי יהרגני."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:39.054747225Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}